      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_659a9993c5ab6356_1",
        "edit": "In the sequential always block, fix the reset polarity (active-low rstn) and the T-flip-flop toggle behavior: change 'if (rstn)' to 'if (!rstn)' so reset clears q to 0, and swap the t branches so q toggles when t is high (q <= ~q) and holds when t is low (q <= q).",
        "lens_id": "dataflow_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module tff (   input clk,\n               input \t  rstn,\n               input \t  t,\n               output reg q);\n   \n   always @ (posedge clk) begin\n    if (!rstn) \n      q <= 0;\n    else\n      if (t)\n        q <= ~q;\n      else\n        q <= q;\n   end\nendmodule\n",
